              "exam_source": "NEET PG High-Yield Practice (NBE / AIIMS Pattern)",
              "topic": "Thoracic Duct Termination",
              "question": "A patient undergoes resection of an esophageal tumor and develops a left-sided chylothorax. Where does the thoracic duct terminate anatomically?",
