              "exam_source": "NEET PG High-Yield Practice (NBE / AIIMS Pattern)",
              "topic": "Winter's Formula in Metabolic Acidosis",
              "question": "In a patient with diabetic ketoacidosis and a serum bicarbonate of 12 mEq/L, what is the expected compensatory arterial PCO2 according to Winter's formula?",
