              "exam_source": "NEET PG High-Yield Practice (NBE / AIIMS Pattern)",
              "topic": "Creatine Synthesis Organs & Precursors",
              "question": "Creatine phosphate serves as a rapid energy buffer in skeletal muscle. Which three amino acids are required for endogenous creatine synthesis?",
