              "exam_source": "NEET PG High-Yield Practice (NBE / AIIMS Pattern)",
              "topic": "Base Excision Repair & AP Endonuclease",
              "question": "During Base Excision Repair (BER) of spontaneous cytosine deamination into uracil, which enzyme recognizes and cleaves the AP (apurinic/apyrimidinic) site?",
