                "high_yield_pearl": "Narrow Therapeutic Index drugs requiring mandatory TDM: Lithium, Digoxin, Warfarin, Theophylline, Phenytoin, Carbamazepine, Aminoglycosides, Vancomycin, Cyclosporine."
