              "exam_source": "NEET PG 2014 Recall",
              "topic": "Antiepileptics - Trigeminal Neuralgia DOC",
              "question": "A 55-year-old female presents with recurrent, unilateral, lancinating electric-shock-like pain along the maxillary distribution of the fifth cranial nerve triggered by light touch and chewing. Which of the following is the medical drug of choice?",
