                "high_yield_pearl": "Drugs that WORSEN Absence Seizures: Carbamazepine, Phenytoin, Vigabatrin, Tiagabine. DOC for Pure Absence = Ethosuximide. DOC for Absence + Generalized Tonic-Clonic = Sodium Valproate."
