              "topic": "Psychopharmacology - Ketamine in Depression",
              "question": "An intranasal formulation of Esketamine (S-enantiomer of ketamine) is administered under clinical supervision for treatment-resistant major depression with imminent suicidal ideation. What is the molecular target mediating its rapid-onset antidepressant efficacy within hours?",
