                "high_yield_pearl": "Thiazolidinedione Toxicities: (1) Fluid retention and Congestive Heart Failure, (2) Weight gain, (3) Increased risk of peripheral bone fractures in women, (4) Bladder cancer association (Pioglitazone)."
