              "exam_source": "NEET PG 2017 Recall",
              "topic": "Osteoporosis - Bisphosphonate Administration",
              "question": "A 65-year-old postmenopausal female is prescribed oral Alendronate for severe osteoporosis. To prevent the severe adverse effect of pill-induced corrosive chemical esophagitis and esophageal ulceration, what instructions must be given?",
