              "question_type": "PRACTICE",
              "exam_source": "NEET PG High-Yield Practice (NBE / AIIMS Pattern)",
              "topic": "Half-Life and Steady-State Kinetics",
              "question": "A continuous intravenous infusion of a drug with a half-life of 8 hours is initiated without a loading dose. How many half-lives are required to reach >95% of steady-state plasma concentration (Css)?",
