              "question_type": "PRACTICE",
              "exam_source": "NEET PG High-Yield Practice (NBE / AIIMS Pattern)",
              "topic": "Organophosphate Poisoning & Atropine Endpoint",
              "question": "In severe organophosphate insecticide poisoning, Atropine is titrated intravenously in doubling doses until which therapeutic clinical endpoint is reached?",
