              "question_type": "PRACTICE",
              "exam_source": "NEET PG High-Yield Practice (NBE / AIIMS Pattern)",
              "topic": "Burkitt Lymphoma t(8;14) & c-Myc",
              "question": "A 10-year-old child presents with a rapidly enlarging jaw mass. Histology demonstrates a 'starry sky' appearance. What chromosomal translocation and oncogene are involved?",
