                "high_yield_pearl": "Tumor Angiogenesis: Hypoxia -> HIF-1alpha stabilization -> VEGF secretion -> Neo-angiogenesis. Bevacizumab binds VEGF. Sunitinib/Sorafenib inhibit VEGF tyrosine kinase receptors."
