              "question": "A 24-year-old asymptomatic female is found to have mild microcytic anemia (Hb 10.5 g/dL, MCV 62 fL, Mentzer index < 13). Serum ferritin and serum iron are normal. Hemoglobin electrophoresis reveals HbA2 of 5.2% (elevated). What is the diagnosis?",
