              "question": "A 4-year-old child presents with bone pain, fever, hepatosplenomegaly, and lymphadenopathy. Bone marrow is replaced by lymphoblasts. Which two marker tests confirm B-cell Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia (B-ALL)?",
