                "high_yield_pearl": "Listeria: Gram-positive rod, Tumbling motility at 25 C (not 37 C), Cold growth (refrigerators), Actin rockets. Causes meningitis in neonates and elderly. Intrinsically resistant to cephalosporins -> Treat with Ampicillin!"
