                  "C": "INCORRECT: Phosphorylation of tyrosine residues is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Attachment of a viral capsid is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
