                  "B": "INCORRECT: Simple superficial skin abrasion is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Contusion on thigh resolving in 5 days is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Minor first-degree thermal erythema is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
