              "topic": "Keratoconus Signs & Diagnosis",
              "question": "A 19-year-old male with allergic eye-rubbing history has progressive irregular astigmatism. On slit-lamp examination, an iron deposition ring is noted at the base of the ectatic corneal cone. What is this sign?",
