                  "B": "INCORRECT: Anterior necrotizing scleritis is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Posterior scleritis is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Corneal ulcer is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
