                  "C": "INCORRECT: Bitemporal hemianopia is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Homonymous hemianopia is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
