                  "B": "INCORRECT: Stocker line is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Ehrnrooth line is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Khodadoust line is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
