                  "B": "INCORRECT: Choroideremia is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Gyrate atrophy is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
