                  "B": "INCORRECT: High-dose oral Vitamin C alone is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Surgical vitrectomy with retinal peel is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Topical Timolol 0.5% is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
