                  "C": "INCORRECT: Oculomotor Nerve (Cranial Nerve III) is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Trigeminal Nerve (Cranial Nerve V1) is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
