                  "B": "INCORRECT: Staphylococcus aureus; MRI brain is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Streptococcus pneumoniae; High-resolution CT is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Aspergillus niger; Plain mastoid X-ray is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
