                  "B": "INCORRECT: Invasive aspergillosis criteria is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Wegener's granulomatosis criteria is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
