              "question": "Following a motor vehicle accident with head injury, a 30-year-old male has clear watery fluid dripping from his left nostril that increases upon leaning forward. The fluid creates a 'halo' / target sign on filter paper and does NOT stiffen a handkerchief. What is the most sensitive and specific biochemical marker for CSF leakage?",
