                  "B": "INCORRECT: Flexible fiberoptic bronchoscopy alone is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Heimlich maneuver when child is stable and coughing is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Chest tube thoracostomy is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
