                "high_yield_pearl": "Laryngeal Innervation Rule: ALL intrinsic muscles innervated by Recurrent Laryngeal Nerve (RLN) EXCEPT: Cricothyroid = External branch of Superior Laryngeal Nerve (EBSLN). Sensory above vocal cords = Internal branch of SLN. Sensory below vocal cords = RLN. EBSLN injury in thyroidectomy causes inability to hit high notes and voice fatigue."
