                  "C": "INCORRECT: Intravenous Ibutilide is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Electrical DC cardioversion is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
