                  "B": "INCORRECT: Third Heart Sound (S3); Rapid passive ventricular filling is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Opening snap of mitral valve is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Ejection click of aortic valve is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
