                  "B": "INCORRECT: Heerfordt syndrome; Poor prognosis requiring lifelong steroids is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Mikulicz disease; High risk of lymphoma is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Kartagener syndrome; Infertility is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
