                  "B": "INCORRECT: Staphylococcus aureus is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Haemophilus influenzae is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Streptococcus pneumoniae is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
