                  "B": "INCORRECT: Lactulose; Direct binding to GABA receptors is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Neomycin as sole monotherapy is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
