                  "B": "INCORRECT: HFE gene mutation; High ferritin is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: SERPINA1 mutation; Low alpha-1 antitrypsin is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: CFTR gene mutation; Elevated sweat chloride is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
