                  "B": "INCORRECT: ATP7B mutation; Chelation is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: RET oncogene mutation; Thyroidectomy is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: JAK2 mutation; Hydroxyurea is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
