                  "B": "INCORRECT: Anti-Smooth Muscle Antibodies (ASMA); Prednisolone is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: p-ANCA; Methotrexate is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
