                  "B": "INCORRECT: High-dose IV Furosemide infusion is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Immediate hemodialysis as sole therapy is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
