              "topic": "Graves' Disease vs Toxic Multinodular Goiter",
              "question": "A 28-year-old female presents with palpitations, heat intolerance, weight loss, fine tremor, diffuse smooth non-tender goiter with an audible vascular bruit, bilateral exophthalmos (proptosis), and pretibial myxedema. What pathognomonic autoantibody drives this disease, and what is the Radioactive Iodine Uptake (RAIU) pattern?",
