                  "B": "INCORRECT: Anti-Thyroid Peroxidase (anti-TPO); Decreased/zero uptake is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Anti-Thyroglobulin; Patchy uptake is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Calcitonin antibodies; Cold nodule is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
