                  "B": "INCORRECT: TSH receptor antibodies; Follicular carcinoma is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Anti-microsomal; Medullary thyroid carcinoma is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Calcitonin; Anaplastic carcinoma is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
