                  "B": "INCORRECT: Depressed C4 with normal C3; Subendothelial deposits is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Normal complement; Linear IgG along GBM is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Normal complement; Effacement of podocyte foot processes is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
