                "high_yield_pearl": "Dermatomyositis vs Polymyositis: Dermatomyositis: Skin rash (Heliotrope + Gottron papules) + PERIFASCICULAR atrophy (perimysial CD4+ T-cells). MANDATORY CANCER SCREENING (Ovarian, lung, breast cancer). Polymyositis: No skin rash. ENDOMYSIAL infiltrate with CD8+ T-cells invading MHC-I expressing fibers. Autoantibody = Anti-Jo-1 (Antisynthetase syndrome: myositis + ILD + mechanic's hands)."
