                  "C": "INCORRECT: Anti-Scl-70; Multiple myeloma is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: c-ANCA; Chronic lymphocytic leukemia is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
