                "high_yield_pearl": "ITP High-Yield Rules: Isolated thrombocytopenia + Normal Hb/WBC + NO splenomegaly! IgG anti-GPIIb/IIIa antibodies. Bone marrow: Increased megakaryocytes. First-line therapy = High-dose Corticosteroids (Dexamethasone/Prednisone) + IVIG. Second-line: Thrombopoietin receptor agonists (Eltrombopag, Romiplostim), Rituximab, or Splenectomy. Routine platelet transfusions are CONTRAINDICATED!"
