                  "B": "INCORRECT: Platelet transfusion immediately is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Systemic Heparin anticoagulation alone is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Emergency bilateral nephrectomy is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
