                "high_yield_pearl": "DIC Coagulation Hallmark: BOTH platelets and coagulation factors are CONSUMED! Prolonged PT + Prolonged aPTT + LOW Fibrinogen + High D-Dimer / FDP + Thrombocytopenia + Schistocytes. Contrast with TTP/ITP: In TTP and ITP, PT and aPTT are completely NORMAL. #1 Management Rule in DIC: Treat the underlying cause! Cryoprecipitate is the blood product of choice to replace depleted Fibrinogen."
