                "high_yield_pearl": "Multiple Myeloma High-Yield Pearls: CRAB Criteria: Hypercalcemia + Renal failure + Anemia + Bone lytic lesions ('punched out' on skull X-ray). Diagnostic triad: SPEP M-Spike + Clonal Marrow Plasma Cells >= 10% + End-organ damage (CRAB). Rouleaux formation on smear. Bence-Jones Proteins = Free monoclonal light chains in urine (detected by sulfosalicylic acid / UPEP, NOT detected by routine urine dipstick which detects only albumin!). Standard Triplet Induction = Bortezomib + Lenalidomide + Dexamethasone (VRd)."
