                  "B": "INCORRECT: Stool culture is positive in week 1; perforation in week 1 is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Widal test is definitive on day 1 is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
