              "topic": "Surgical Site Infections (SSI) - CDC Definitions",
              "question": "Under CDC/NHSN surveillance definitions, within how many postoperative days must an infection occur to be classified as a Superficial Incisional Surgical Site Infection (SSI), and what defines a Clean-Contaminated (Class II) surgical wound?",
