                  "B": "INCORRECT: Within 7 days; Class II is an emergency dirty wound is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Within 1 year without implant; Class II has gross pus is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Within 60 days; Class II has traumatic laceration is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
