                "high_yield_pearl": "Inguinal Hernia Master Rule: Inferior Epigastric Artery is the dividing line! Indirect Hernia: LATERAL to inferior epigastric artery, through deep ring into spermatic cord (patent processus vaginalis). Direct Hernia: MEDIAL to inferior epigastric artery, through Hesselbach's Triangle floor (acquired transversalis fascia weakness). Hesselbach Triangle Boundaries: Medial = Rectus sheath; Lateral = Inferior epigastric vessels; Inferior = Inguinal ligament. Inguinal hernia repair standard: Lichtenstein Tension-Free Mesh Repair (polypropylene mesh)."
