              "question": "Which specific eponymous hernia is defined by the incarceration or strangulation of only a PORTION OF THE CIRCUMFERENCE of the antimesenteric bowel wall, which can undergo ischemic necrosis and perforation WITHOUT producing complete mechanical intestinal obstruction?",
