                  "B": "INCORRECT: Polyp size >= 3 mm is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Polyp size >= 5 mm is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Polyp size >= 20 mm only is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
