                  "B": "INCORRECT: Type I; Tumor strictly below confluence is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Type IIIa; Extends into right secondary ducts is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
