                  "B": "INCORRECT: Clinical exam + CT chest + Blood CA 15-3 is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Ultrasound + MRI + FNA only is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Self-examination + PET scan + Excision is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
