                  "B": "INCORRECT: Giant Fibroadenoma; Simple enucleation is adequate is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Invasive lobular carcinoma; Chemotherapy is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
