                "high_yield_pearl": "Anaplastic Thyroid Carcinoma: Elderly patients. Rock-hard, rapidly enlarging mass + Stridor + Dysphagia + Hoarseness. 100% are STAGE IV at diagnosis. Molecular: p53 mutation. Histology: Bizarre pleomorphic giant and spindle cells. Median survival: 3-6 months. Palliative management (airway securing + palliative chemoradiation). BRAF inhibitors (Dabrafenib + Trametinib) for BRAF-mutant tumors."
