                  "B": "INCORRECT: Arterial ischemic ulcer; Emergency bypass is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Venous ulcer; High-pressure compression stockings is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
