                "high_yield_pearl": "Foot Ulcers High-Yield Pearls: Neuropathic Ulcer: Plantar foot / Metatarsal heads. Painless + Thick callus rim + Sensation lost (10g monofilament) + Strong pulses! Treatment = OFFLOADING (Total Contact Cast) + Callus debridement. Arterial Ulcer: Distal toes. Exquisitely PAINFUL (worse when lying flat in bed) + Absent pulses + Pale base. Treatment = Arterial Revascularization (Bypass / Angioplasty). Marjolin's Ulcer = Squamous Cell Carcinoma arising in chronic burn scar / osteomyelitis sinus / long-standing venous ulcer (biopsy mandatory for any chronic non-healing ulcer with everted edges!)."
