                  "B": "INCORRECT: Size > 1 cm only is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Attenuation < 0 HU is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
