              "topic": "Cephalopelvic Disproportion (CPD) & Pelvic Diameters",
              "question": "Which of the following pelvic diameters is the SMALLEST and most critical anteroposterior diameter of the pelvic inlet that the fetal head must negotiate during engagement, and what is its normal measurement?",
