                  "B": "INCORRECT: Push the cord back into the uterus is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Clamp and cut the cord immediately is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
