                "high_yield_pearl": "Urinary Incontinence Comparison: Stress Incontinence (SUI): Leak on cough/sneeze (NO urge!). Cause: Urethral hypermobility. Treatment = Kegel exercises -> Mid-Urethral Sling (TVT / TOT). Urge Incontinence (OAB): Sudden intense urge followed by leak. Cause: Detrusor Overactivity. Treatment = Bladder training -> Anticholinergics (Oxybutynin) or Beta-3 Agonist (Mirabegron). Overflow: High post-void residual (> 200 mL) -> Catheterization."
