                  "B": "INCORRECT: Cesarean section injury; MRI scan is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Hysterectomy; Ultrasound is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Radiation; Biopsy is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
