                "high_yield_pearl": "Vesicovaginal Fistula (VVF): Cause in Developing Countries = Obstructed Labor (ischemic pressure necrosis sloughs at 7-10 days!). Cause in West = Hysterectomy. Three-Swab Test: Bladder filled with Methylene Blue: Swabs stain BLUE = VVF. Swabs wet with CLEAR urine (unstained by blue dye) = Ureterovaginal Fistula! Martius Fat Pad graft used in complex repairs."
