              "topic": "Cervical Cancer - HPV Strains & Screening Guidelines",
              "question": "Which high-risk Human Papillomavirus (HPV) genotypes are responsible for > 70% of all invasive cervical squamous cell carcinomas worldwide, and what oncoproteins inactivate p53 and Rb tumor suppressors?",
