                  "B": "INCORRECT: Mucinous adenocarcinoma is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Endometrioid carcinoma is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Clear cell carcinoma is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
