                  "B": "INCORRECT: Single hCG measurement at 1 month is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Repeat ultrasound every week without blood tests is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Hysterectomy follow-up only is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
