                "high_yield_pearl": "Post-Molar Follow-up Protocol: Primary Treatment = SUCTION CURETTAGE. Follow-up: WEEKLY Beta-hCG until 3 normal levels (< 5 mIU/mL), then MONTHLY for 6 months! Strict contraception during follow-up (COCs preferred). FIGO GTN Criteria: Plateau of hCG for 3 weeks, OR Rise of hCG by >= 10% for 2 weeks, OR hCG persistence > 6 months. Post-molar GTN treatment = Methotrexate (Low-Risk) or EMA-CO (High-Risk)."
