              "topic": "SAM 10-Step Inpatient Stabilization Protocol",
              "question": "Under WHO guidelines for the inpatient management of Severe Acute Malnutrition (SAM) with complications, what is the initial feeding formula used during the Stabilization Phase, and which nutrient is STRICTLY WITHHELD during initial stabilization?",
