                "high_yield_pearl": "Rickets Master Summary: Defective mineralization of growth plates. Earliest Sign = CRANIOTABES (ping-pong ball skull < 6 mo). Thorax: RACHITIC ROSARY (smooth, rounded, painless) + Harrison Sulcus. Wrist X-ray: CUPPING, SPLAYING, FRAYING of metaphysis. Labs: Low/Normal Ca + LOW Phosphate + MARKEDLY HIGH ALP + High PTH. Scurvy (Vitamin C deficiency) comparison: Bleeding gums + Subperiosteal hematoma (pseudoparalysis) + White line of Fraenkel + Pelkan spur + Wimberger ring sign + Painful, angular Scorbutic Rosary!"
