                  "B": "INCORRECT: Galactokinase (GALK); Mild cataracts only is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Uridine diphosphate galactose 4-epimerase (GALE) is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Fructose-1-phosphate aldolase; Hereditary fructose intolerance is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
