                "high_yield_pearl": "Neonatal Hypoglycemia Guide: Threshold = Blood Glucose < 40-45 mg/dL. At-Risk = Infant of Diabetic Mother (IDM: Hyperinsulinism). Emergency DOC = IV 'MINI-BOLUS' OF 10% DEXTROSE at 2 mL/kg over 2 mins! NEVER give D25 or D50 (triggers fatal rebound hypoglycemia). Follow with continuous Glucose Infusion Rate (GIR) of 6-8 mg/kg/min."
