                "high_yield_pearl": "Intussusception Master Pearls: Peak age 5-9 months. ILEOCOLIC #1. Classic Triad: Colicky pain with leg drawing + 'SAUSAGE-SHAPED' MASS (RUQ, Dance's sign empty RIF) + 'RED CURRANT JELLY' STOOL. Ultrasound = 'TARGET' / 'DONUT' SIGN. Treatment DOC = PNEUMATIC (AIR) ENEMA REDUCTION (85% success). Surgery indicated if peritonitis, perforation, or enema failure!"
