                "high_yield_pearl": "Pediatric UTI & VUR Imaging Pearls: Gold standard sampling in non-toilet trained infants = Urethral catheterization (or Suprapubic Aspiration: 1 colony = positive!). Imaging Algorithm: 1st febrile UTI = RENAL BLADDER ULTRASOUND (RBUS). Gold Standard for VUR = MICTURATING CYSTOURETHROGRAM (MCU / VCUG). Gold Standard for RENAL CORTICAL SCARS = DMSA SCAN (cold defect). Low-grade VUR resolves spontaneously; High-grade VUR causes reflux nephropathy."
