                "high_yield_pearl": "Cystic Fibrosis Master Summary: Autosomal recessive. Gene = CFTR on chromosome 7q31. #1 Mutation = DELTA-F508 (loss of Phenylalanine). Earliest sign = MECONIUM ILEUS (15-20% at birth; 'soap-bubble' X-ray). Exocrine Pancreas failure -> Steatorrhea + Failure to thrive + Fat-soluble vitamin deficits (A, D, E, K). #1 Pathogen = S. aureus (infants) -> PSEUDOMONAS AERUGINOSA (older). Gold Standard Diagnosis = SWEAT CHLORIDE >= 60 mmol/L! Modern Cure/Treatment = CFTR Modulators (Trikafta: Elexacaftor/Tezacaftor/Ivacaftor)."
