                  "C": "INCORRECT: Complete foot drop paralysis; Pressure > 50 mmHg is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Cold, pale extremities; Delta pressure > 60 mmHg is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
