              "question": "A motorcyclist sustains an open fracture of the tibia. Examination reveals a 12 cm contaminated transverse wound with extensive periosteal stripping and muscle crushing, but with adequate soft-tissue coverage allowing bone coverage without a flap. What is the Gustilo-Anderson grade, and what is the antibiotic protocol?",
