                  "C": "INCORRECT: Type 1 collagen defect; Bisphosphonates is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Vitamin D resistance; Calcium infusion is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
