                "high_yield_pearl": "Aneurysmal Bone Cyst (ABC) Master Pearls: Age < 20 yrs. Metaphysis of long bones & Spine posterior elements. Radiograph = 'BLOW-OUT' EXPANSILE ballooned lesion with 'Eggshell' rim. MRI Hallmark = PATHOGNOMONIC 'FLUID-FLUID LEVELS' (blood layering). Histology: Blood-filled spaces without endothelial lining + USP6 gene rearrangement (17p13). Curettage or Sclerotherapy."
