                "high_yield_pearl": "De Quervain's Tenosynovitis Summary: Stenosing tenosynovitis of FIRST EXTENSOR COMPARTMENT. Contents = ABDUCTOR POLLICIS LONGUS (APL) & EXTENSOR POLLICIS BREVIS (EPB). 'Mother's wrist' from lifting baby. Pathognomonic Test = FINKELSTEIN'S TEST (fist with tucked thumb deviated to ulnar side -> sharp pain at radial styloid!). Treatment = Thumb Spica splint -> Steroid sheath injection -> Surgical retinacular release."
