                  "C": "INCORRECT: Secondary syphilis; Requires IM Penicillin G is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Parvovirus B19; Causes severe aplastic anemia is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
