                  "B": "INCORRECT: Human Papillomavirus; Koilocytes is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Herpes Simplex Virus; Cowdry A bodies is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Parvovirus B19; Guarnieri bodies is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
