                "high_yield_pearl": "Molluscum Contagiosum Master Pearls: POXVIRUS (Double-stranded DNA). Pearly, dome-shaped papules with CENTRAL UMBILICATION expressing curd-like core. Histopathology Hallmark = HENDERSON-PATERSON (MOLLUSCUM) BODIES (huge intracytoplasmic inclusions displacing nucleus). Self-limiting in kids (clears in 6-12 mo). Giant facial lesions indicate severe HIV infection!"
