                "high_yield_pearl": "Cutaneous Leishmaniasis Master Summary: Leishmania tropica / major transmitted by FEMALE SANDFLY (Phlebotomus). Exposed skin -> Painless, crater-like ulcer with INDURATED RAISED BORDERS ('DELHI BOIL' / 'Oriental Sore'). Heals with depressed scar. Giemsa stain = LEISHMAN-DONOVAN (LD) BODIES (amastigotes with nucleus + bar-like kinetoplast inside macrophages). Treatment = Intralesional/IM SODIUM STIBOGLUCONATE or Liposomal Amphotericin B."
