                "high_yield_pearl": "Cutaneous Tuberculosis Master Pearls: LUPUS VULGARIS is #1 form in immune adults (face/neck). PATHOGNOMONIC TEST: DIASCOPY reveals 'APPLE-JELLY NODULES' (yellow-brown granulomas). Long-term risk = Squamous Cell Carcinoma (Marjolin ulcer). SCROFULODERMA = Direct breakdown from tuberculous lymph nodes/bone -> discharging sinus with puckered scar (#1 in Indian kids). Treatment = 6 months standard ATT (HRZE)."
