                "high_yield_pearl": "Dermatophytosis Master Pearls: Trichophyton rubrum is #1 dermatophyte worldwide! Tinea Corporis = Annular scaly plaque with ACTIVE ADVANCING BORDER & central clearing (scrape margin for KOH!). 10% KOH = UNIFORM, BRANCHING, SEPTATE HYPHAE. TINEA CAPITIS: Topical creams do NOT work! DOC = ORAL GRISEOFULVIN (6-8 weeks) or Terbinafine. KERION = Boggy purulent abscess-like inflammatory plaque (add short-course steroids to prevent scarring alopecia!). Onychomycosis DOC = Oral Terbinafine (12 weeks)."
