                "high_yield_pearl": "Cutaneous Anthrax Master Pearls: Bacillus anthracis (Spore-forming Gram-positive 'boxcar' rod). Contact with animal hides/leather. Evolution: Painless papule -> Vesicle -> CENTRAL DEPRESSED COAL-BLACK NECROTIC ESCHAR ('Malignant Pustule') surrounded by MASSIVE GELATINOUS EDEMA. Pathognomonic: COMPLETELY PAINLESS with NO PUS! Blood agar = 'MEDUSA-HEAD' colonies. Treatment DOC = Oral CIPROFLOXACIN or DOXYCYCLINE."
