              "exam_source": "NEET PG High-Yield Practice (NBE / AIIMS Pattern)",
              "topic": "SSRI Sexual Dysfunction Mechanism",
              "question": "A 27-year-old male with depression started on an antidepressant complains of delayed ejaculation and decreased libido, but has had good mood improvement. Which neurotransmitter mechanism underlies this adverse effect?",
