                "high_yield_pearl": "Adult Brain Tumors: GBM = Intra-axial, thick irregular ring enhancement + central necrosis + crosses corpus callosum; Meningioma = Extra-axial, dural-based, intense uniform enhancement + 'Dural Tail Sign'; Schwannoma = Cerebellopontine angle, ice-cream cone sign with IAC widening."
