                "high_yield_pearl": "Bowel Obstruction Rules of 3, 6, 9: Normal maximum diameters: Small bowel < 3 cm; Colon < 6 cm; Cecum < 9 cm. SBO = Central loops + Valvulae conniventes traverse whole diameter + multiple air-fluid levels. LBO = Peripheral loops + Haustra traverse partially."
