                  "B": "INCORRECT: Acute Peripancreatic Fluid Collection is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Walled-Off Pancreatic Necrosis (WOPN) is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Chronic pseudocyst is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
