                "high_yield_pearl": "Pancreatitis Imaging Timeline (Atlanta): Perform contrast CT after 72 hours (early CT underestimates necrosis). Early collections (< 4 weeks): Interstitial = Acute Peripancreatic Fluid Collection; Necrotizing = Acute Necrotic Collection. Late collections (> 4 weeks): Interstitial = Pseudocyst (epithelial-free fibrous wall); Necrotizing = Walled-Off Pancreatic Necrosis (WOPN)."
