              "question": "A 28-year-old primigravida experiences catastrophic, life-threatening postpartum hemorrhage (PPH) refractory to uterine massage, bimanual compression, oxytocin, and carboprost. She remains hemodynamically stabilized on transfusions and wishes to preserve fertility. What interventional radiology procedure is the definitive fertility-sparing treatment of choice?",
