                "high_yield_pearl": "Capnography Signatures: Normal = Crisp rectangular box; 'Shark-fin' = Bronchospasm / COPD / Obstructed ETT; 'Curare Cleft' = Neuromuscular blockade wearing off (diaphragmatic notch in phase III); Rapid zero flatline = Esophageal intubation, disconnected circuit, or Cardiac arrest; Elevated baseline (>0) = Rebreathing of CO2 / exhausted soda lime."
