                  "B": "INCORRECT: Normal Saline is directly acidic with a pH of 2.0 is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Normal Saline causes acute lactic acid production is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Normal Saline poisons renal tubular phosphate reabsorption is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
