                "high_yield_pearl": "IV Crystalloid Pearls: Normal Saline (0.9% NaCl): Na+ 154, Cl- 154 -> causes Hyperchloremic Metabolic Acidosis and renal vasoconstriction with large volumes. Ringer's Lactate (RL): Na+ 130, Cl- 109, K+ 4, Ca2+ 3, Lactate 28 mOsm/L -> physiological, lactate converted to HCO3- in liver; avoid in brain trauma (hypotonic 273 mOsm/L worsens cerebral edema). Maintenance fluids: 4-2-1 Rule (4 mL/kg/h for 1st 10kg, 2 mL/kg/h for 2nd 10kg, 1 mL/kg/h for each kg above 20kg)."
