                "high_yield_pearl": "ACLS Cardiac Arrest Summary: Shockable = VF & Pulseless VT. Step 1: SHOCK! Step 2: CPR 2 min. Step 3: Shock #2 -> Epinephrine 1 mg q3-5m. Step 4: Shock #3 -> Amiodarone 300 mg (or Lidocaine). Non-Shockable = Asystole & PEA. NO shock! High-quality CPR + Epinephrine 1 mg q3-5m + treat reversible causes (5 H's and 5 T's: Hypovolemia, Hypoxia, Hydrogen ion/acidosis, Hypo/hyperkalemia, Hypothermia; Tension pneumo, Tamponade, Toxins, Thrombosis PE, Thrombosis MI)."
